title: "LavaFlow Mapper Suite"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python application for the near-real-time mapping and monitoring of active
  lava flows from NASA FIRMS VIIRS and MODIS thermal anomalies.
type: software
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Panch021/LavaFlow_Mapper_Suite"
keywords: [volcano, lava flow, VIIRS, MODIS, FIRMS, thermal remote sensing, hazard assessment]
